{"content_hash": "4b6483b0ea43cda4", "version_id": 1054, "article_id": 107, "level_code": "en_b2", "lang": "en", "level": 4, "level_label": "B2 中高级", "title": "Xiaomi's Mijia Smart Fish Tank 2 Pro adds space, top filter and spotlight", "title_zh": "小米米家智能鱼缸2 Pro增加空间、顶部过滤器和聚光灯", "has_translation": true, "topic": "lifestyle", "source": "sspai", "source_url": "https://sspai.com/post/119023", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1571008887538-b36bb32f4571?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8N3x8cHJvfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTU0OTc5NDZ8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by sporlab on Unsplash", "author": "sporlab", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@sporlab?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/pair-of-blue-and-white-adidas-running-shoes-XiZ7pRvCzro?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(206, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(244, 46%, 48%)", "label": "LIFESTYLE", "seed": "4886abeeaa35"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-24", "word_count": 252, "reading_minutes": 1.3, "lead": "Xiaomi has launched the Mijia Smart Fish Tank 2 Pro, the third model in its smart aquarium series. The tank is bigger, filters water differently and adds a spotlight that makes aquascapes look more dramatic.", "lead_zh": "小米推出了米家智能鱼缸2 Pro，这是其智能水族箱系列的第三款产品。这款鱼缸更大，采用不同的水过滤方式，并新增了一盏聚光灯，让水景造景看起来更富戏剧感。", "preview": "The new tank holds about 30 litres, up from roughly 20 litres in the first generation, an increase of around 55 percent. For people who enjo", "preview_zh": "新鱼缸容量约为30升，相比第一代约20升增加了约55%。对于喜欢水景造景的人来说，多出的空间意味着可以放置更大的装饰物，前后层次更清晰，而斑马鱼等群游鱼类也有更多游动空间。代价是换水需要更大的容器，装满水后鱼缸更重，因此家具必须能承受其重量。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 1037, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/107/en_b2.mp3", "duration": 90.675, "size_bytes": 545040, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 284, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/107/en_b2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 92.2, "size_bytes": 554112, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 284, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/107/en_b2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/107/en_b2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 98.175, "size_bytes": 589968, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 284, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/107/en_b2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/107/en_b2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 85.725, "size_bytes": 515376, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 284, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/107/en_b2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/107/en_b2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 92.3, "size_bytes": 554688, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 284, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/107/en_b2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@62070c4b/content/data/versions/1054.json", "paragraphs": ["The new tank holds about 30 litres, up from roughly 20 litres in the first generation, an increase of around 55 percent. For people who enjoy aquascaping, the extra space means larger decorations and clearer front-to-back layers, while schooling fish such as zebrafish have more room to swim. The trade-off is that water changes need bigger containers and the filled tank is heavier, so furniture must support it.", "The filter has moved from the back of the tank to the top, and a dry-wet separation design now traps fish waste and leftover food before they soak in the water. The stronger pump pushes more water and creates more bubbles, improving oxygen levels. A first chamber can hold a heater, and a 5W waterproof port is reserved for extras such as a UV lamp.", "Lighting is the most eye-catching upgrade. A spotlight above the tank focuses light on wood, rocks and plants, creating strong contrast, especially in a dim room. The main light now uses 24 white and 24 RRGB LEDs, so it is far brighter than before: a setting of 20 percent on the 2 Pro matches about 60 percent on the older model.", "The tank still works with the Mijia app and Xiao Ai voice control, letting users check temperature, set timers and schedule feeding. A new feature recommends pump, light and feeding settings based on the fish chosen. Some problems remain, however: mist forms on the glass in cool weather, and the feeding amount can no longer be adjusted mechanically."], "paragraphs_zh": ["新鱼缸容量约为30升，相比第一代约20升增加了约55%。对于喜欢水景造景的人来说，多出的空间意味着可以放置更大的装饰物，前后层次更清晰，而斑马鱼等群游鱼类也有更多游动空间。代价是换水需要更大的容器，装满水后鱼缸更重，因此家具必须能承受其重量。", "过滤器从鱼缸后部移到了顶部，干湿分离设计现在能在鱼粪和剩余饲料浸入水中之前将其拦截。更强的水泵推动更多水流并产生更多气泡，从而提高氧气水平。第一个仓室可放置加热棒，并预留了一个5W防水接口，用于紫外线灯等额外设备。", "照明是最引人注目的升级。鱼缸上方的聚光灯将光线集中在沉木、石头和水草上，形成强烈对比，在昏暗的房间里尤其明显。主灯现在使用24颗白色和24颗RRGB LED灯珠，因此比之前亮得多：2 Pro上20%的亮度设置大约相当于旧款60%的亮度。", "这款鱼缸仍支持米家App和小爱语音控制，让用户可以查看温度、设置定时器和安排喂食。一项新功能会根据所选的鱼推荐水泵、灯光和喂食设置。不过，一些问题仍然存在：天气凉爽时玻璃上会起雾，而且喂食量不能再通过机械方式调节。"], "body": "The new tank holds about 30 litres, up from roughly 20 litres in the first generation, an increase of around 55 percent. For people who enjoy aquascaping, the extra space means larger decorations and clearer front-to-back layers, while schooling fish such as zebrafish have more room to swim. The trade-off is that water changes need bigger containers and the filled tank is heavier, so furniture must support it.\n\nThe filter has moved from the back of the tank to the top, and a dry-wet separation design now traps fish waste and leftover food before they soak in the water. The stronger pump pushes more water and creates more bubbles, improving oxygen levels. A first chamber can hold a heater, and a 5W waterproof port is reserved for extras such as a UV lamp.\n\nLighting is the most eye-catching upgrade. A spotlight above the tank focuses light on wood, rocks and plants, creating strong contrast, especially in a dim room. The main light now uses 24 white and 24 RRGB LEDs, so it is far brighter than before: a setting of 20 percent on the 2 Pro matches about 60 percent on the older model.\n\nThe tank still works with the Mijia app and Xiao Ai voice control, letting users check temperature, set timers and schedule feeding. A new feature recommends pump, light and feeding settings based on the fish chosen. Some problems remain, however: mist forms on the glass in cool weather, and the feeding amount can no longer be adjusted mechanically.", "body_zh": "新鱼缸容量约为30升，相比第一代约20升增加了约55%。对于喜欢水景造景的人来说，多出的空间意味着可以放置更大的装饰物，前后层次更清晰，而斑马鱼等群游鱼类也有更多游动空间。代价是换水需要更大的容器，装满水后鱼缸更重，因此家具必须能承受其重量。\n\n过滤器从鱼缸后部移到了顶部，干湿分离设计现在能在鱼粪和剩余饲料浸入水中之前将其拦截。更强的水泵推动更多水流并产生更多气泡，从而提高氧气水平。第一个仓室可放置加热棒，并预留了一个5W防水接口，用于紫外线灯等额外设备。\n\n照明是最引人注目的升级。鱼缸上方的聚光灯将光线集中在沉木、石头和水草上，形成强烈对比，在昏暗的房间里尤其明显。主灯现在使用24颗白色和24颗RRGB LED灯珠，因此比之前亮得多：2 Pro上20%的亮度设置大约相当于旧款60%的亮度。\n\n这款鱼缸仍支持米家App和小爱语音控制，让用户可以查看温度、设置定时器和安排喂食。一项新功能会根据所选的鱼推荐水泵、灯光和喂食设置。不过，一些问题仍然存在：天气凉爽时玻璃上会起雾，而且喂食量不能再通过机械方式调节。", "text": "The new tank holds about 30 litres, up from roughly 20 litres in the first generation, an increase of around 55 percent. For people who enjoy aquascaping, the extra space means larger decorations and clearer front-to-back layers, while schooling fish such as zebrafish have more room to swim. The trade-off is that water changes need bigger containers and the filled tank is heavier, so furniture must support it. The filter has moved from the back of the tank to the top, and a dry-wet separation design now traps fish waste and leftover food before they soak in the water. The stronger pump pushes more water and creates more bubbles, improving oxygen levels. A first chamber can hold a heater, and a 5W waterproof port is reserved for extras such as a UV lamp. Lighting is the most eye-catching upgrade. A spotlight above the tank focuses light on wood, rocks and plants, creating strong contrast, especially in a dim room. The main light now uses 24 white and 24 RRGB LEDs, so it is far brighter than before: a setting of 20 percent on the 2 Pro matches about 60 percent on the older model. The tank still works with the Mijia app and Xiao Ai voice control, letting users check temperature, set timers and schedule feeding. A new feature recommends pump, light and feeding settings based on the fish chosen. Some problems remain, however: mist forms on the glass in cool weather, and the feeding amount can no longer be adjusted mechanically.", "vocab": [{"word": "aquascape", "pos": "noun", "zh": "水族造景", "note": "指鱼缸内的景观布置", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "generation", "pos": "noun", "zh": "代", "note": "产品迭代常用 first generation", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "upgrade", "pos": "noun", "zh": "升级", "note": "也可作动词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "filter", "pos": "noun", "zh": "过滤器", "note": "动词意为过滤", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "trap", "pos": "verb", "zh": "截留、困住", "note": "此处指拦住污物", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "oxygen", "pos": "noun", "zh": "氧气", "note": "增氧 improve oxygen levels", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "spotlight", "pos": "noun", "zh": "射灯", "note": "聚光照明", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "contrast", "pos": "noun", "zh": "对比度", "note": "明暗对比", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "schedule", "pos": "verb", "zh": "安排、设定", "note": "schedule feeding 定时喂食", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "recommend", "pos": "verb", "zh": "推荐", "note": "名词 recommendation", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "mist", "pos": "noun", "zh": "雾气", "note": "玻璃起雾", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "mechanically", "pos": "adv", "zh": "机械地", "note": "指用机械结构调节", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "